  "body": "While this is a reasonable implementation strategy to get O(1), it makes the algorithm a lot harder to read. We should get the index of the item in the list instead when it comes time to compare. That will require defining index in Infra, but that seems like a good thing to be doing regardless.\r\n\r\ncc @mfreed7 @josepharhar @domenic ",
